 "Q244": {
  "cannot": "Profit requires cost of goods sold and revenue. Revenue for rice (RICE-SM-5KG) is recorded in daily-sales-june for the eleven followed items. However, cost_inr in products is a single per-unit cost (not additive, not a total cost of goods sold), and no table records the actual cost paid for the rice units sold, nor any other expenses. Therefore profit cannot be computed from the records."
 },
